  "description": "✨ Graffiti Giggle – Fun Urban Graffiti Font\nBring playful street vibes to your designs with Graffiti Giggle, a bold and colorful graffiti display font that’s packed with personality! This font bursts with energy, featuring chunky bubble-style letters, cartoon eyes, comic-inspired accents, and dripping spray-paint details that give it a truly urban edge.\nPerfect for:\n* Kids’ game titles\n* Streetwear branding\n* YouTube and Twitch graphics\n* Urban posters & hip-hop flyers\n* Comic covers, cartoon logos & stickers\nWhat’s Included:\n* Uppercase & lowercase letters\n* Numbers & full punctuation\n* Unique character variations with doodle-style expressions\n* BONUS PNG elements (colorful graffiti alphabets)\n* File formats: OTF, TTF, and PNG (for creative mockups)\nWhether you’re designing for print, digital, or merch , Graffiti Giggle will add a fresh, bold, and funny twist to your work. Bring laughter and bold attitude to your designs with Graffiti Giggle – a must-have for any creative graffiti lover!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>✨ Graffiti Giggle – Fun Urban Graffiti Font<br>\nBring playful street vibes to your designs with Graffiti Giggle, a bold and colorful graffiti display font that’s packed with personality! This font bursts with energy, featuring chunky bubble-style letters, cartoon eyes, comic-inspired accents, and dripping spray-paint details that give it a truly urban edge.</p>\n<p>Perfect for:</p>\n<p>* Kids’ game titles</p>\n<p>* Streetwear branding</p>\n<p>* YouTube and Twitch graphics</p>\n<p>* Urban posters &amp; hip-hop flyers</p>\n<p>* Comic covers, cartoon logos &amp; stickers</p>\n<p>What’s Included:</p>\n<p>* Uppercase &amp; lowercase letters</p>\n<p>* Numbers &amp; full punctuation</p>\n<p>* Unique character variations with doodle-style expressions</p>\n<p>* BONUS PNG elements (colorful graffiti alphabets)</p>\n<p>* File formats: OTF, TTF, and PNG (for creative mockups)</p>\n<p>Whether you’re designing for print, digital, or merch , Graffiti Giggle will add a fresh, bold, and funny twist to your work. Bring laughter and bold attitude to your designs with Graffiti Giggle – a must-have for any creative graffiti lover!</p>",
